feat: add universal retry functionality to Recruiting

Recruiting now stores last search params and retries exact same call.

Implementation:
- Add lastSearchParamsRef to store exact search params { q, location, radius }
- Store params before each search for replay
- Create retry() function that replays exact placesProxySearch call
- Debounced (500ms) to prevent spam clicks
- Disabled during in-flight requests
- Logs retry actions with userAction='retry'

Consistency:
- Discover: Already had retry via usePlacesSearch hook ✅
- Recruiting: Now has matching retry implementation ✅
- Both store and replay exact params (not current UI state)

Error handling:
- On retry success: Results update, error clears
- On retry failure: New error shown, retry still available
- Stale results: Shows cached with banner if retryable error

Files changed:
- src/components/Recruiting.tsx: Add lastSearchParamsRef + retry()
- RETRY_IMPLEMENTATION.md: Complete documentation

Closes consistent retry implementation across Discover + Recruiting.
